# =============================================
# Returns a signature of the current TOP window from sys(194), used to detect whether
# an action changed the top window (a new window opened OR an existing one brought to front).
# Must use sys(194) — C++ windows (value, find, ...) do not appear in $topwind/$iwindows.
# Signature = windowname of the top row + classitem name + isMethodEditor flag.
# Residual limit: two windows with an identical signature are indistinguishable.
# =============================================
Calculate allWindows as sys(194)
Quit method con(allWindows.1.windowname,'|',allWindows.1.classitem().$name,'|',allWindows.1.isMethodEditor)